<Base title="About" description="Why 815live exists: Rockford-area live music listings that don't require a Facebook account.">
  <h1>About 815live</h1>
  <p>
    Most local shows in Rockford, Loves Park and Belvidere only get posted on Facebook. 815live collects them in one
    place: who's playing, where, when, and what it costs, no account needed.
  </p>
  <p>
    The focus is local bands at bars, breweries and small venues. Show submissions are coming soon. Until then, you can
    subscribe to the <a href="/calendar.ics">calendar feed</a> or <a href="/rss.xml">RSS</a>.
  </p>
